# Change Log
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](http://keepachangelog.com/)
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/).

[1.0.5] - 2026-09-28

### Fixed

- Prevent false-negative error notification when EnvyControl succeeds with non-fatal initramfs notices.
- Prevent duplicate contradictory notifications after switching GPU modes.
- Improved privilege escalation error handling (added exit code 126).

[1.0.4] - 2026-09-28

### Added

- Contextual right-click actions to switch GPU modes directly.
- Complete Spanish translations.

### Changed

- Modernized imports and UI components for KDE Plasma 6.
- Replaced slow recursive filesystem search with `command -v` for instant notification tool detection.
- Theme-adaptive color formatting.

### Fixed

- Contextual actions compatibility with Plasma 6 applet requirements.
- Notification tool argument handling and error reporting.

[1.0.3] - 2025-05-16


### Added

- NixOS support.

### Changed

- New logo.

[1.0.2] - 2024-04-01

### Added

### Changed

- Enhanced GPU switching logic and improved notification messages.

### Fixed

[1.0.1] - 2024-03-30

### Added

### Changed

- Updated installation instructions in README.

### Fixed

- System tray widget not working in some environments.

[1.0.0] - 2024-03-17

### Added

- Initial KDE Plasma 6 port.

### Changed

- Migrated from `kdesu` to `pkexec` for privilege escalation.
- Updated metadata format for Plasma 6 (`KPackageStructure: Plasma/Applet`).
- Widget root changed to `PlasmoidItem` as required by Plasma 6.

### Fixed
